{"municipality_code":"12422","pref":"千葉県","city":"睦沢町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"睦沢町には、上市場村、川島村、寺崎村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には古墳や貝塚、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「台遺跡」、「浅間山一号墳」、「能満寺古墳」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、上市場村や川島村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 田・新田・用水にちなむ地名が多い場所では、土地改良碑や用水記念碑も注目したい探索対象です。 川沿いや水辺では、暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を伝える案内板、治水碑、河川改修の記念碑にも注目してみてください。 「上総十二社」や「三之宮神社」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":14,"rank":1265,"percentile":32.1,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":1,"rank":1311,"percentile":22.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":5,"rank":1814,"percentile":2.5,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":1,"rank":1791,"percentile":2.1,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":2,"rank":1236,"percentile":23.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":14,"rank":988,"percentile":45.8,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"